show_hn.body:
I built ContextLattice because agent work should survive the window. It is a local-first intelligence layer that preserves mission state, ranks the evidence a task actually needs, carries bounded context across harnesses, and records which outcomes worked.

The CLI is the primary interface; HTTP and MCP are companion surfaces.

Quickstart: {docs_url}
Repo: {repo_url}

I would value feedback on retrieval quality, continuity, and operational ergonomics.

